<title>ARGENTINA: RESEARCH ALERT - Banco Frances cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Banco Frances cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Santander Investment analysts Lisa Riley and Laura Berdeja on Thursday downgraded their rating for Argentina's Banco Frances to underperform from buy.</p>
<p>-- They cut their Frances earnings per American Depositary Receipt estimate to $1.20 from $1.97 for 1997 and to $1.29 from $2.33 for 1998.</p>
</text>
